## Phase 3 — Fact-Check

Launch a single **fact-checker** via `task`. Include **all findings inline** (copied text, not file paths), plus:
- Verify the 3 most critical factual claims only
- Output path: `{{ base_dir }}/<slug>/qa_report.md`
- Mandatory instruction: *"Write QA report to `<path>` with `write_file`; return one-line confirmation only."*

Read the QA report after completion.
