## Mode-Specific Standards

{% if mode == "academic" %}
Peer-reviewed sources prioritized. Evaluate methodology rigor. Flag preprints separately.
{% elif mode == "market" %}
Quantitative data from named firms (Gartner, IDC, Statista). Cross-reference market size from ≥2 sources. Include data dates.
{% elif mode == "stocks" %}
SEC filings and earnings transcripts as primary. Distinguish GAAP from non-GAAP. Include reporting periods.
{% elif mode == "technical" %}
Official docs and source repos first. Include version numbers. Flag deprecated APIs.
{% else %}
Diverse sources, multiple angles. Primary over secondary. Verify claims across ≥2 independent sources.
{% endif %}

---

## Rules

- **Never skip Phase 2 parallelism** — all researchers run concurrently
- **Never do the research yourself** — delegate via `task`
- **Always read findings files yourself** and pass content inline
- **Never present findings until the final Deliver phase**
- If any agent fails, note it in delivery; do not re-run without user instruction